# A Wall that loses defender can attack; Venom on its blocker does not destroy the Wall (CR 702.3b, 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Kraken Hatchling
Venom
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Steel Wall
Fresh Start
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kraken Hatchling.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Venom.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Kraken Hatchling)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Steel Wall.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Fresh Start.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall)
? Bot2.Mana =
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Steel Wall)
Bot1.Block(Kraken Hatchling > Steel Wall)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Kraken Hatchling.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Venom.AttachedTo = Kraken Hatchling
